(31173, 'Intermission: Docked and Loaded', 'Gallywix drops into the arena |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214226|h[Cratering]|h|r any in his way, gaining |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214229|h[Armageddon-class Plating]|h|r and then casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1214369|h[Total Destruction!!!]|h|r until interrupted.', 2646, 107, 0, 31174, 30498, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 0, 0, 59888),
